                                    Drive!</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                            <fo:block-container page-break-before="avoid" space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                    Hi, I'm Cerberus, a 10-month-old German Shepherd–Boxer mix! I'm
                                    an energetic and intelligent working dog breed looking for my
                                    forever home. If you enjoy working with intelligent, responsive,
                                    and energetic dogs, then Cerberus may be an ideal fit. Please
                                    read through this PDF guide to see if we're a good match!   </fo:block></fo:block-container>
